{"id":"624890","name":"茴香鸡蛋馅饼","author":"雨中漫步li","authorId":"10274398","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/624890/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"茴香","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"1个"},{"name":"面粉","amount":"200克"}],"sub":[{"name":"芝麻油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"45°温水","amount":"120克"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"面粉用温水合面软一点，醒面2小时，中间揉面2次，这样柔软劲道。","img":"images/624890/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"茴香洗净。","img":"images/624890/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"切碎。","img":"images/624890/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"打入鸡蛋，放盐、芝麻油。","img":"images/624890/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"拌匀备用。","img":"images/624890/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"面团分成均匀的剂子。","img":"images/624890/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"擀成薄薄的面饼。","img":"images/624890/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放上馅料。","img":"images/624890/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"上面盖上一层，把边缘按压好。","img":"images/624890/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"电饼铛烧热，放入馅饼，预约馅饼功能键。","img":"images/624890/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"分钟左右，面饼鼓起就可以了。","img":"images/624890/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/624890/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"鲜香好吃。","img":"images/624890/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电饼铛\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}